<title>USA: Texas Department of Housing $169 mln revs priced.</title>
<headline>Texas Department of Housing $169 mln revs priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said it tentatively priced $169 million of Texas Department of Housing and Community Affairs single-family mortgage revenue bonds, with a top yield of 6.20 in 2028.</p>
<p>The bonds are MBIA insured.  </p>
